  "details": "-Open VRC already logged into an account\n\n-wheel menu > options > gesture lock: \n\nfunction properly at this point, as it should be\n\n-main menu settings > Logout\n\n-log back into the same account or another\n\n-wheel menu > options > gesture lock: \n\ntoggle get stuck in a loop of toggling itself on and off indefinitely, until going into another menu or closing the wheel menu, at which point the the toggle will set itself on or off depending of whichever state it was on when closing/changing menu.\n\nThis is not a new bug, it has been happening reliably with the stated above conditions for at least 3 months.",
